  <data name="obligations_details_summary_heading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Why does the recycling obligations table already have tonnage awaiting acceptance?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_intro" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tonnage awaiting acceptance is for PRNs or PERNs that have been issued to you but have not yet been accepted.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_before_list_1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You have been issued at least one December waste PRN or PERN.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_before_list_2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>These:</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_bullet_1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>are for packaging waste received for recycling at UK or overseas reprocessing sites in December</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_bullet_2" xml:space="preserve"> 
    <value>can be accepted towards either your {0} or {1} recycling obligations</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_bullet_3" xml:space="preserve">     
    <value>have a blue tag to show which years you can accept them towards</value>
 </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_after_list" xml:space="preserve">     
    <value>A December waste PRN or PERN will appear under ‘Tonnage awaiting acceptance’ for both {0} and {1} until you accept it towards a specific year’s recycling obligations.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="obligations_details_summary_content_end" xml:space="preserve">               
    <value>Once you accept the PRN or PERN towards a specific year, it is assigned to that year only and the blue tag is removed.</value>
